# Build context for the Protea image (Dockerfile). Dependencies are installed and
# everything is built inside the builder stage, so local outputs stay out.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.git
.github
.dev-data
.dev-data.log
.dev-pid
protea-data
docs
**/.DS_Store
docker/observability
